{"seq":19,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:57:59.484Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c1e52852c64b25aeb18c102cbbac0cd3576b45ab778ca3ea8f80783c7a826f92","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests say, newest evidence first:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato owns it now. It moved from Nadia Fennimore to Gideon on **2026-05-04**. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\". The 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day, with Mateo Quiroga notified at 08:30. The 8/3 and 9/30 digests show Gideon working it.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day. The 12/1/2025 digest already calls it \"Gideon's fleet account\", so he may have had it before then. The digests don't say who held it earlier.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, though the digests never name the account outright. The 9/30 and 12/1/2025 digests both refer to \"Gideon's medical account\". A March 2025 digest called Orlavine \"Nadia's medical account\", so it appears to have changed hands at some point. No digest records that handoff.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't confirm an owner from the digests. They only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia is the one acting on it: she volunteered to run the 10/2 gate-clerk training and relayed their Dock Door 4 request on 10/13. That points to Nadia, but it's an inference, not a stated assignment.\n\nBefore this goes on the board, check Quillfeather and Orlavine against the CRM. I can't see the account CRM files from here."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
